    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon</em></p><p>As a Magic action, you can clamp these cables onto a dead creature and try to bring it back to life by making a DC 15 Intelligence (Arcana) check using @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulTinkersToo]{Tinker's Tools}. On a success, the creature returns to life with 1 Hit Point, provided it has been dead for no more than 1 minute and didn’t die of old age. On a failure, you take 2d6 Lightning damage.</p><p>Once used, a set of <em>Goblin Jumper Cables</em> can’t be used again until the next dawn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-cTPI13ACwPRBHeFa\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Jump-Start</em> fait le test (Arcanes ou outils de bricoleur) et dépense l’utilisation du jour ; sur une réussite, rendez 1 point de vie à la créature, sur un échec utilisez <em>Backlash</em>.</p></section>",
